 "reading": "On every fault copy verify exited 7 and emdf and oamd 0 before the change; after it all three exit 7 (the CLI tests). On the 55 inputs no exit code changes and both commands exit as verify does on every one. Both now take about as long as verify: on the E-AC-3 film emdf 91 s to 123 s and oamd 94 s to 123 s, verify alone 118 s; on the TrueHD film oamd 1.5 s to 27 s, verify 28 s. With the pass of verify run after the walk instead of beside it, emdf took 209 s on the E-AC-3 film",
